  "A flexible process for turning complex product and brand needs into a coherent digital system.": "先理清问题，再搭系统，最后把视觉和交互做完整",
  "I work from structure toward expression: define the task, map the content, establish reusable rules, then use type, colour, material and motion to give the system a distinct point of view.": "我通常从结构走向表达：先明确任务和使用场景，梳理内容层级，再建立可复用的版式、字体、颜色和组件规则，最后用材质、动效和细节让系统形成自己的观点。AI 会参与资料整理、方向比较、界面草稿、局部素材生成，以及中英文长度和重复表达的检查。它帮助我更快探索，但问题是否定义清楚、信息是否有层级、交互是否成立，仍要由我判断。",
  "Audience, content, constraints and the decisions the interface needs to support.": "明确受众、内容、限制条件，以及界面要支持的决策；同时整理参考资料，判断哪些探索适合交给 AI。",
  "Flows, layouts, type, colour, components and responsive behaviour.": "先定义流程、版式、字体、颜色和组件规则，再用 AI 生成方向变体和界面草稿，把可用部分收回系统。",
  "Working interactions, edge states and the details that make the system hold together.": "用可运行的交互和边界状态验证系统；AI 可以补素材和状态草稿，关键节奏与可用性仍需逐项检查。",
  "Structure before surface": "结构先定",
  "Define the information architecture, the task and the context before styling the screen. A strong system makes every visual decision easier.": "先把任务、信息层级和使用场景说清楚。AI 可以整理资料、拆分页面和生成初稿，但结构是否成立仍由我判断。",
  "Systems over screens": "规则先行",
  "Build reusable type, spacing, colour and component rules so each screen feels specific without becoming disconnected from the whole.": "先定义字体、颜色、间距和组件规则，再用 AI 快速生成变体、补齐中英文长度和边界状态，最后筛选回系统。",
  "Motion with a reason": "结果可验",
  "Use movement to reveal hierarchy, explain a state change and reward exploration. Precision matters more than the number of effects.": "动效和视觉都服务于层级与状态变化。AI 适合探索分镜、素材和过渡草案，时长、节奏和最终交互仍要实际检查。",
  "Structure first": "结构先定",
  "Start with the information, the task and the context. Visual decisions should make the system easier to understand, not just more expressive.": "先明确信息、任务和使用场景，再让 AI 参与资料整理、页面拆分和初稿生成。结构是否成立，不交给模型判断。",
  "Atmosphere with intent": "方向先行",
  "Colour, type, material and motion are used to build a recognisable world around the work while preserving reading comfort.": "先确定字体、颜色、材质和动效的方向，再用 AI 生成风格变体和局部素材，从中筛选能留在系统里的部分。",
  "Evidence over theatre": "结果可验",
  "Finished screens, working interactions and technical checks are presented for what they are. Research and testing are never inferred.": "AI 可以加快探索和校对，但最终要看真实页面、边界状态和交互结果。没有验证过的部分，不写成成果。",
  "A few clear lines are enough to begin.": "项目背景、改动目标和预期体验",
  "About / Resume and practice": "简历 / 经历与实践",
  "Start with the problem, build the system, then complete the visual and interaction design.": "先理清问题，再搭系统，最后把视觉和交互做完整",
  "How I work": "工作方式",
  "I usually move from structure to expression: define the task and context, map the content hierarchy, and establish reusable rules for layout, type, colour and components. I then use material, motion and detail to give the system its own point of view. AI helps with research sorting, comparing directions, interface drafts, local asset generation, and checking bilingual length and repeated wording. It speeds up exploration, but it does not decide whether the problem is defined, the hierarchy holds or the interaction works.": "我通常从结构走向表达：先明确任务和使用场景，梳理内容层级，再建立可复用的版式、字体、颜色和组件规则，最后用材质、动效和细节让系统形成自己的观点。AI 会参与资料整理、方向比较、界面草稿、局部素材生成，以及中英文长度和重复表达的检查。它帮助我更快探索，但问题是否定义清楚、信息是否有层级、交互是否成立，仍要由我判断。",
  "From problem to validation": "从问题到验证",
  "Define the audience, content, constraints and decisions the interface must support. Sort the reference material and decide where AI can usefully contribute.": "明确受众、内容、限制条件，以及界面要支持的决策；同时整理参考资料，判断哪些探索适合交给 AI。",
  "Define flows, layouts, type, colour and component rules first. Then use AI to generate direction variants and interface drafts, and bring only the useful parts back into the system.": "先定义流程、版式、字体、颜色和组件规则，再用 AI 生成方向变体和界面草稿，把可用部分收回系统。",
  "Test the system through working interactions and edge states. AI can draft assets and state variations; timing and usability still need direct review.": "用可运行的交互和边界状态验证系统；AI 可以补素材和状态草稿，关键节奏与可用性仍需逐项检查。",
  "Design and AI collaboration": "设计与 AI 协作原则",
  "Clarify the task, information hierarchy and use context first. AI can sort material, break down pages and draft screens, but I still decide whether the structure holds.": "先把任务、信息层级和使用场景说清楚。AI 可以整理资料、拆分页面和生成初稿，但结构是否成立仍由我判断。",
  "Rules before variants": "规则先行",
  "Define type, colour, spacing and component rules first. Then use AI to generate variants, bilingual length tests and edge states, and keep only what still belongs inside the system.": "先定义字体、颜色、间距和组件规则，再用 AI 快速生成变体、补齐中英文长度和边界状态，最后筛选回系统。",
  "Results must hold": "结果可验",
  "Use visual and motion decisions to clarify hierarchy and state changes. AI is useful for exploring sequences, assets and transition drafts; timing, pacing and the final interaction still need direct review.": "动效和视觉都服务于层级与状态变化。AI 适合探索分镜、素材和过渡草案，时长、节奏和最终交互仍要实际检查。",
  "Results must be verified": "结果可验",
  "App design and flow": "应用设计与流程",
  "One pet.": "一只宠物",
  "One record.": "一份记录",
  "Next in the index /": "继续浏览 /",
  "Selected projects": "选择项目",
  "Practice and point of view": "实践与观点",
  "Systems and motion": "系统与动效",
  "I'm Jin Fanhao, a designer working across UI design, 3D modeling, visual design and AI-assisted animation.": "我是 Jin Fanhao，一名设计师，实践覆盖 UI 设计、3D 建模、视觉设计和 AI 辅助动画。",
  "I have worked on toy product development, including model design for furniture role-play and ride-on toy series, as well as sticker artwork, layout and product introduction videos. AI supports my animation, short video and visual asset production, so my work moves between interfaces, models and motion.": "我参与过玩具产品开发，涉及家具角色扮演与骑乘玩具系列的模型设计，也做过贴纸、排版和产品介绍视频。AI 主要参与动画、短视频和视觉素材的制作，我的工作因此会在界面、模型和动态内容之间展开。",
